# Build outputs. Committed by accident once: `git add prototypes/sc_panel`
# swept in 99 generated files including a 2,940-line project.assets.json, which
# would have inflated every line count in REPORT-C1.md's own directory and put
# NuGet lock state under review. The file that measures a line count should not
# sit beside 5,000 lines of generated noise.
bin/
obj/
# The C1 receipt is written beside the exe by the run itself; it is DATA, and
# the copy that matters is quoted in REPORT-C1.md.
sc-c1.json
sc-error.txt
